# Raw landmark cache. Regenerated from the videos by
# scripts/cache_raw_landmarks.py — ~26 MB of derived .npz.
#
# The small v3/v4 feature caches under data/features* stay tracked on
# purpose: they are the exact inputs that produced the V3 fallback
# model, so keeping them makes that model reproducible.
backend/training/data/raw_landmarks/
backend/training/data/metadata/raw_landmark_cache_index.w*.json

